### ==================== 变量 ====================
# 先用 loginTest.http 的用例1或2登录，拿到 token 替换下面
@token = 331509ef-0027-41c1-bab4-4e1e255dc4e0




### ==================== 内容点赞 ====================

### 1. 正常点赞内容
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

contentId=1


### 2. 正常取消点赞内容
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/remove
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

contentId=1


### ==================== 评论点赞 ====================

### 3. 正常点赞评论
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

commentId=1


### 4. 正常取消点赞评论
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/comment/remove
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

commentId=1


### ==================== 异常 — 重复操作 ====================

### 5. 重复点赞内容 — 对已点赞的内容再次点赞
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

contentId=2


### 6. 取消点赞未点赞的内容
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/remove
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

contentId=3


### 7. 重复点赞评论
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

commentId=2


### 8. 取消点赞未点赞的评论
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/comment/remove
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

commentId=3


### ==================== 异常 — 目标不存在 ====================

### 9. 点赞不存在的内容
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

contentId=99999


### 10. 点赞不存在的评论
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

commentId=99999


### ==================== 异常 — 参数校验 ====================

### 11. 缺少 contentId
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded


### 12. contentId 不是数字
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

contentId=abc


### 13. 缺少 commentId
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded


### 14. commentId 不是数字
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

commentId=abc


### ==================== 异常 — 鉴权 ====================

### 15. 不带 token — AuthFilter 拦截
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/add
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

contentId=1


### 16. 伪造 token — AuthFilter 拦截
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/add
token: fake-token-12345
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

contentId=1


### ==================== 异常 — 路径 ====================

### 17. 未识别的 action
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/unknown
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

contentId=1


### ==================== 查询 — 内容 ====================

### 18. 查询是否已点赞某内容 — 已点赞
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/status?contentId=2
token: {{token}}


### 19. 查询是否已点赞某内容 — 未点赞
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/status?contentId=3
token: {{token}}


### 20. 查询内容点赞数
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/count?contentId=2
token: {{token}}


### ==================== 查询 — 评论 ====================

### 21. 查询是否已点赞某评论
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/comment/status?commentId=2
token: {{token}}


### 22. 查询评论点赞数
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/comment/count?commentId=2
token: {{token}}


### ==================== 查询 — 鉴权 ====================

### 23. 查询点赞状态 — 不带 token
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/status?contentId=1


### 24. 查询点赞数 — 不带 token
GET http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/like/content/count?contentId=1